  "description": "The native payload for Agora's software video encoder extension (full-video-codec-enc 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. The software H.264/H.265 encoder, used when the device's hardware encoder is unavailable or unusable for the requested profile. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is selected by the engine itself once present in the RTC binding.",
